WEBVTT

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.400
Everyone, gather round!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.530
Ako Nyan-Nyan! {previously we used Ako-nyanko}

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.240
On today's show,

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:21.700
we got to observe a shoebill, 
a bird famous for keeping totally still.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:22.750
But then...

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:29.380
Just when I thought all it was going to do was stare at me, it suddenly opened its wings and gave me a scare!

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.260
What a surprise!

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:35.130
Wasn't it fun learning all sorts of new things today?

00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.140
Lots of fun!

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.810
All together now!

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.270
We love animals!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.020
Ako Nyan-Nyan!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:47.270
That stupid shoebill wasn't cool at all.

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.360
Platypuses are way better.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.780
And stronger!

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:55.030
Tell me more, Tetsuya-kun.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.160
Sure! They've got venomous claws on their back legs!

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.290
Venom...

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:01.910
Kick!

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:05.330
Oh, my. Now, now, how rambunctious you are.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:08.170
Oh, it's just about time to say goodbye.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:13.920
Next week, a sheep from New Zealand will be coming to visit us in the studio.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.510
Yay!

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:19.010
A Tasmanian devil from New Zealand would be better!

00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:22.520
Come now everyone, let's bid our viewers farewell.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:24.980
See you next week!

00:01:24.980 --> 00:01:26.690
Be sure to tune in!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.280
Bye-bye!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:07.200
That was this week's recording.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.540
The kids all look totally engaged!

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:14.040
I'm impressed that you're able to host a children's show so well.

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:15.670
Must be great.

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:19.550
True. As an idol with fans of all ages and genders,

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:23.680
this role takes full advantage of my universal appeal.

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.720
It must be pretty tough, though.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:32.060
Well, some children get rowdy occasionally, but that's what makes them charming.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.610
Now then, I should probably hand these over to you.

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:37.150
Finally!

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:38.610
Thanks.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.110
That's right. You two will be making a guest appearance on the show.

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.490
That gets me going!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:51.500
Yume and Koharu aren't the only guests next week—
a real live sheep will be visiting the studio as well.

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.380
Oh yeah, you did say something like that before.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:57.340
I bet the kids'll be really happy!

00:03:57.340 --> 00:03:59.170
I'll have to do my part too.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:03.430
Of course. And Yume, this will be a live broadcast,

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.470
so do try not to stutter.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.800
Just you watch!{I know but}

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.680
I'm so glad.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.440
About appearing on Ako-chan's show?

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:15.810
Yeah, there's that too,

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:20.400
but it's starting to sink in that I actually got a Star Premium Rare Coord.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.820
Oh, that?

00:04:21.820 --> 00:04:24.530
Thank you so much again, Koharu-chan.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:28.410
Come on, how many more times will it take until you're satisfied? It wasn't just me.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.000
It happened because we worked together.

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.080
Yeah!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.340
I want to make even more inspired designs for Rainbow Berry Parfait!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.590
Me too!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:41.340
Oh, that reminds me. Ako-chan said,

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:47.300
"I wouldn't mind you doing an introduction of your brand during the show", so I want to do a good job.

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.640
That's important.

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.390
Plus, we don't want to be overshadowed by the sheep.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.890
Yume-chan, you want to compete with it?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:59.020
Actually, didn't she say the sheep was from New Zealand?

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.110
What about it?

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:05.530
That sounds kind of familiar for some reason... {Machida Touko has been terrible for this season of Stars. I hope it's not because she was also doing Centaur}{wait, really?}

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:07.530
Elza-sama,

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:11.290
would you like any milk or lemon?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:12.660
No, thank you.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.750
I'll take it straight.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:16.670
Very well.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:22.210
<i>Yume Nijino obtained the Earth Star Premium Rare Coord.</i>

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.550
<i>Only two Star Wings remain.</i>

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:27.300
Elza-sama!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.550
What's the matter, Kirara?

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:35.940
Listen to this! I finally made it back on board the ship, but now I have to go back to Japan for a TV show!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.980
I see. I'll call for a private jet to pick you up.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.240
Thanks, Elza-sama!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:49.320
Oh yeah! Since I'm going, I should bring a present for Ako-chan!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.750
Should we make a poster showing off several of our dresses?

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:03.630
That's not a bad idea, but I think talking about the brand ourselves would be better.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.630
I think the kids would be able to appreciate that more.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.800
You have a point.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.800
For example, we could do a paper play. {I have never had to make this word before}{I have never had to do this word before}

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:13.260
Good idea!

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.810
You both seem to be rather focused.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.180
Ako-chan.

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:21.480
This is our first chance to promote Rainbow Berry Parfait on TV.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.820
I'm super amped to do it!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.320
I'll be sure to expect a good show from you tomorrow.

00:06:28.320 --> 00:06:29.360
Okay!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:35.200
Now then, I think we have a good grasp on the progression.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:41.080
Before we begin, I must give you a few tips on how to interact with the children.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.090
Tips?{propoint: tips are better than points}{frankly whatever}

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:50.380
First off, there may be children who don't want to follow your instructions, but you must always be nice to them.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:57.140
Next, sometimes a child may wander off by themselves, but it's your job to bring them back into the group.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:07:02.360
And finally, even if a child acts naughty, you should never get angry with them.

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:04.400
Okay, got it.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.610
It sounds as rough as I thought.

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:10.740
Well, if it ever gets too difficult, you can leave it to me.

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:13.120
Yes?

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.740
Good morning, Ako-chan.

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:17.620
Yamaguchi-san!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.500
Yume-chan, Koharu-chan, it's good to see you again too.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.920
Good to have you today.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.250
Thank you.

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:26.670
Oh right, I need to introduce you to our other guests.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.390
Hello!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.430
Kirara?

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:47.900
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.360
It's for work!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.450
Huh?

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:54.030
But I'm not the one working.

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:58.290
What?! Then...

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.080
So the sheep from New Zealand really was her!

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:06.210
Carol-tan is a super famous animal idol!

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.300
I had no idea! I guess not everyone's how they seem.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.840
Sorry, sorry!

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.720
Fluffy puffy...

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:21.020
I know you just got here, but are you ready for rehearsal?{are we going to ignore that fuwamoko thing?}{I had a feeling I missed one...}

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.440
Yes!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:24.270
Yes...

00:08:25.020 --> 00:08:27.400
Saotome Ako-san and guests on set!

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.650
It's a real sheep!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.200
So fluffy and puffy!

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.750
Let's get right into the rehearsal!

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.920
We'll start with an energetic greeting from Ako-chan!

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:50.670
Good nyaning! It's Saotome Ako-nyan!

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:55.380
It's time for today's Everyone Gather Round Ako Nyan-Nyan! {killed some punctuation}

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:58.680
Say it with spirit: we love animals!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.060
Ako Nyan-Nyan!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.940
Good! Now call down our guests.

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:09.190
We have some very special guests visiting us today.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:13.320
Our first group is a couple of idols from my school, Four Star Academy.

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:16.910
Nijino Yume-san and Nanakura Koharu-san!

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:19.070
I'm Nijino Yume!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:21.040
I'm Nanakura Koharu.

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:23.080
Thank you for having us.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:29.380
In just a while, they'll be telling you all about Rainbow Berry Parfait.

00:09:29.380 --> 00:09:30.380
Right.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:36.590
And if you remember last week's preview, you should know that we have an animal guest as well.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.890
It's Caroline-san all the way from New Zealand!

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:47.650
Yah-ho! It's Kirara and Caroline!

00:09:47.650 --> 00:09:48.940
Kiraran!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.320
Hey, Kirara! Why did you come out with her?

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:57.530
Because it looked like fun!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:09:59.320
Kirara wants in too!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.830
Are you kidding...

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.840
Yamaguchi-san?

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:15.630
Sure, I don't see a problem. We'll just have a livelier episode this time.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.090
I understand.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.470
Yay!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.770
It's time for Did You Know That?

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:32.520
We share more history with sheep than most other animals.

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:39.360
Milk from sheep is often used for cheese, yogurt, and other products.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:46.500
Also, sheep wool is used to make sweaters and more, helping us in our daily lives.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.920
She's really fluffy and puffy!

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.790
Fluffy puffy... {ok here's the issue. the fuwamoko is separate from the fuwafuwa mokomoko. I could try to be clever, but probably just removing the grammar is good enough}{oh, okay. I guess we should not skip the earlier one then}

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:55.250
Hey!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:57.630
You join in too, Ako-chan!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.050
Fluffy puffy...

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:15.020
And so that's how you two combined your talents and powered up your brand. {considered 'improved'}{I considered it too}

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:15.980
That's right.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.900
And the result of our actions

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.910
was the Rainbow Étoile Coord.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:22.410
It's so cute!

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.410
So pretty!

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.040
Wouldn't you like to wear it yourself?

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.160
Yeah!

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:33.830
Okay, we're good!

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.460
That was perfect. Let's keep it up for the broadcast.

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.710
Okay.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.630
I'll do it!

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:46.100
Excuse me, have you forgotten this is <i>my</i> show?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.680
Listen here, you are absolutely not allowed to do anything strange.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.230
What would be strange?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:52.350
Huh?

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:55.650
Oh, just forget it.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:57.520
Anyways, look.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:03.610
Did Yume-chan and Koharu really make that rainbow coord together?

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:05.780
Yes, they certainly did.

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.370
Does that bother you?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.040
Not really.

00:12:11.750 --> 00:12:15.130
<i>Must be nice together. I wish I could...</i>

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.840
That reminds me, Kirara.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:21.260
Back during Venus Wave, you lost to Rola.

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:24.970
Yeah, I was really disappointed.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.720
You let FuwaFuwa Dream down.

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:30.470
You need to do a better job as muse.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:35.440
I thought so too, so I've been working really hard since I left Japan!

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:36.650
Look.

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:40.400
My Aikatsu Ranking is way up there now.

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:46.660
And it's only gonna get higher after today's gig with Carol-tan!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.160
Right, Carol-tan?

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:51.330
Huh? Where's Carol-tan?

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:54.420
She was with us just a moment ago.

00:12:56.420 --> 00:12:58.290
Caroline disappeared?!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.670
I think so.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:02.050
She was gone before we knew it.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:04.930
I wonder if she was scared to go on TV.

00:13:04.930 --> 00:13:07.340
She looked fine with it to me.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:15.060
Carol-tan takes her work seriously, so she would never, ever walk away from a job she accepted!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.150
<i>Could it be?</i>

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.650
Ako-chan?

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:26.950
I knew it.

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:29.660
Tetsuya-kun is gone.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:35.460
Stupid sheep aren't cool at all.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:37.960
Why don't they all get it?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.840
I'll show them who's right.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.270
Hey, stop! Knock it off!

00:13:54.270 --> 00:13:56.100
H-Huh?

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:58.480
She really is fluffy and puffy.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.150
Fluffy puffy!

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.200
Tetsuya-kun?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.910
There's a chance.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:14.160
Got it. He couldn't have gone far. Please look for him.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.580
On it!

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:19.790
Unfortunately, we can't delay on our end. 
Everyone get on standby.

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.380
Okay...

00:14:21.380 --> 00:14:25.510
Should we start with our segment and try to buy time?

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.050
We might have to.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:31.180
No, that won't last long enough.

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:36.390
I'll do a full scan of my mental database.

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.440
Tick tick tick tick...

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:42.020
Ding-dong! Kirara just got a bright idea!

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:46.780
What is it now?

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.530
How about me and you do a performance?

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:53.030
Oh, that could work!

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.030
Huh?

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.450
Yeah, since Kirara-chan's here and all.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:01.920
I agree. The kids will love it too.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.460
But I haven't prepared a dress for today.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:09.470
Don't worry! I brought one for you too!

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.550
Huh?!

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:13.430
All right, we're changing the program!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.350
Okay!

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:15.350
What?!

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.940
Isn't this...

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.200
Fluffy puffy...

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:41.210
What is it?

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:45.460
I'm just really happy about being able to go on stage with you!

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.420
Did you forget already?

00:15:49.760 --> 00:15:55.050
I've said since the very beginning that I wanted us to be muses together.

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.140
You still haven't given that up?

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:01.980
Didn't I tell you?

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:11.150
And don't you still love FuwaFuwa Dream as much as I do?

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:14.410
As much as you?

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.910
Please. My love for it is far greater!

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:21.040
I brought a present for you.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:26.460
This is...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.880
The Melty Yellow Bell Coord.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.470
Isn't it cute like a mischievous cat?

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:36.220
It's a dress just for you.

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:38.220
Kirara...

00:16:38.680 --> 00:16:40.350
Mine is this.

00:16:41.310 --> 00:16:43.560
The Melty Pink Bell Coord.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:50.230
It uses a star-and-moon motif with lots of ribbons all over. Isn't it so FuwaFuwa Dream?

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:56.870
I suppose I can't withdraw now. 
Let's make this a fantastic performance!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.240
Okay!

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:01.790
Saotome Ako, making a dazzling entrance!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:06.000
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:49.720
That's a wrap!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.020
I was worried what we would do for a while there.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:56.190
I'm glad we didn't have any problems.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:21:00.730
We found Tetsuya-kun and Caroline in time for the show too.

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:07.410
Really, pranks are baaad, okay?

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.530
I'm sorry.

00:21:09.530 --> 00:21:10.830
But...

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:15.080
Oh man, sheep are the best!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.340
Fluffy puffy...

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:23.260
It looks like he came to like Caroline as well.

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:27.390
And you two were totally in tune with each other on stage.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:28.850
Right, right?

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:32.770
Well, that would be because I skillfully managed to match her.

00:21:32.770 --> 00:21:34.390
Thanks, Ako-chan!

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:39.440
Hey, you'll keep on doing it with me like Yume-chan and Koharu do, right?

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:40.730
I...

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:45.280
You'll be able to share your worries 
and encouragements with each other.

00:21:45.280 --> 00:21:49.620
Yeah. And two heads can come up with way more ideas too.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:52.410
See?

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:57.460
Isn't it fun being a double muse?

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.170
A double muse...

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:04.300
I suppose if you insist.

00:22:04.300 --> 00:22:08.430
However, be prepared to face the full extent of my abilities.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:13.470
Yay! Now we can work together to make FuwaFuwa Dream better!

00:22:13.470 --> 00:22:17.230
I get it already, so would you please let go of me?

00:22:17.230 --> 00:22:19.020
What, but why?

00:22:19.020 --> 00:22:22.320
Aren't we friends? Just let me!

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:23.730
Geez...

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.870
The Melty Yellow Bell Coord was perfect for you!

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:04.040
Now we can be the double muse of FuwaFuwa Dream!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:10.010
I stick to my word. Get ready to see the best performances I can put on!

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:12.470
I haven't had off-time in so long.{I prefer this but I don't remember which we've before}

00:24:12.470 --> 00:24:14.140
I can't wait to relax at home—

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:15.430
Ding-dong!

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:16.810
Mahiru-chan!

00:24:16.810 --> 00:24:19.020
Well, there goes that plan.

00:24:19.020 --> 00:24:21.100
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:22.520
Kasumi family holiday. {fuck it}

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:24.650
Become the first-star idol!
